      "user": "gamer-f5fd817",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Great game a little lacking on the content side of things but the community made mods and missions definitely carry. Its also playable without a Hotas but id highly recommend one, again playable but not fun without a hotas and sadly no gamepad support so its either janky keyboard or expensive Hotas. Something great that it has over the later games is its verity of factions and locations. Its spans from the Eastern front all the way to the pacific with odd under represented factions like finland and romania."
    },
